{
  "dom_id": "step-21148",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving Cubic Equations by Manipulating the Equation and Then Grouping",
  "problem": "Solve $8x^3+3=4x^2+6x.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we subtract $4x^2$ and $6x$ from both sides to make the right side $0.$ To prepare for factoring by grouping, we make sure to write the resulting cubic in standard form.\n\n$$\n8x^3-4x^2-6x+3=0\n$$\n\nNext, we factor by grouping. Notice that when grouping the smaller terms, we factor out the negative sign.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-6x+3 & = \\\\ (8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2})-(6x-3) & = \\\\ 4{x}^{2}(2x-1)-3(2x-1) & = \\\\ (2x-1)\\cdot 4{x}^{2}-(2x-1)\\cdot 3 & = \\\\ (2x-1)(4{x}^{2}-3).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we set each factor equal to $0$ and solve.\n\n- Setting the factor $(2x-1)$ equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-1 & =0 \\\\ 2x & =1 \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Setting the factor $(4x^2-3)$ equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}-3 & =0 \\\\ 4{x}^{2} & =3 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{4}} \\\\ x & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x= -\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}, \\; \\dfrac12, \\; \\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-21148\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"21148\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"5880\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-21148\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-11\">Solving Cubic Equations by Manipulating the Equation and Then Grouping</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"21148\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: